# Build context of the images (deploy/containers/*/Containerfile, repository root), as an allowlist (D-146): the Go module and the one
# folder of generated data the scan-base image copies. Anything new that a build needs must be listed here.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
# the project's own license: scripts/hostlicenses puts it beside the third-party ones (D-155 (10))
!LICENSE
# the terms of use and the root package that embeds them (D-544): core shows and versions them
!TERMS.md
!terms.go
!cmd
!core
!modules
!internal
# internal/webui/dist (the built interface, gitignored, made by make webui-dist) rides along with !internal (D-149).
!content
!host
!deploy/containers/scan-base/pack
!deploy/containers/honeypot
!deploy/osquery
!scripts/hostlicenses
!deploy/containers/scan-base/nuclei
